{"4086570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moth Terra", "steam_appid": 4086570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moth Terra is a Moth Biome Building Game. Explore and discover lots of Moths by placing plants and flowers to create expansive nocturnal and thriving ecosystems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/7a343c10488bd246aa4f8e2d0917ff2d.avif?t=1788296553\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras_big/7a343c10488bd246aa4f8e2d0917ff2d.avif?t=1788296553 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/fd5a95533f4ba8668e7324993c32c0d3.avif?t=1788296553\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras_big/fd5a95533f4ba8668e7324993c32c0d3.avif?t=1788296553 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attract Moths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create, build and terraform to discover, explore and attract real moths. Place plants and flowers complimentary to the moths you want to attract, place tiles and grasses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/7a6f637b58750aaf50004859b41314fd.poster.avif?t=1788296553\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/7a6f637b58750aaf50004859b41314fd.webm?t=1788296553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/7a6f637b58750aaf50004859b41314fd.mp4?t=1788296553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real Moths in different biomes, like Jersey Tiger, Cinnabar, White-Spotted and Hummingbird, all found in the Urban Garden Biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Moths: </strong>You can play as different Moths with special building and terraforming abilities.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Biomes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create moonlit nature-dioramas and biomes for Moths. Connect your biomes, which you can go back to and unlock more bonuses as you discover more moths and more resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/adcc9fedb824bbfe5c13eab666301050.poster.avif?t=1788296553\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/adcc9fedb824bbfe5c13eab666301050.webm?t=1788296553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/adcc9fedb824bbfe5c13eab666301050.mp4?t=1788296553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Biomes like Urban gardens, Forests, and Sandy dunes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experiment with Nature</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gently learn through experimentation about each Moth you discover and keep them in your biomes by finding out which flowers, grasses, plants and biomes they like. Expand your dioramas to explore and discover more moths. Expand your dioramas to explore and discover more moths. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real nighttime flowers, and wild flowers like Cornflowers, Moon flowers, Night-Scented.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/6bd4ff6f8f53e867453143c5a45f3b05.avif?t=1788296553\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras_big/6bd4ff6f8f53e867453143c5a45f3b05.avif?t=1788296553 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relaxing Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider the placement of your plants, with limited resources until you progress further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/d3872e3e01e1e691975470a130103e7f.avif?t=1788296553\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras_big/d3872e3e01e1e691975470a130103e7f.avif?t=1788296553 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build your nature-dioramas unlocking new terrain, terraforming abilities, and plants for your mothpunk worlds as you progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/92301d1413cd72582c06c5dabb886a67.avif?t=1788296553\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras_big/92301d1413cd72582c06c5dabb886a67.avif?t=1788296553 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gentle Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for the moths in your dioramas and biomes to unlock the next level. Re-wild and attract moths and experiment with plant placement to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Moths can fade away depending on how you build your dioramas. You can always recover your garden through careful building and planting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/f6a702a9235042f5b16ab36548a10093.avif?t=1788296553\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras_big/f6a702a9235042f5b16ab36548a10093.avif?t=1788296553 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Moth Terra offers</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build living gardens instead of cities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements, Unlocks and Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle building and strategy with meaningful progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discoverable Moth species with DLC's planned to explore Moths around the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discoverable Plants species</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Nighttime Biomes (some day biomes) with atmospheric vibes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moth Terra is a Moth Biome Building Game. Explore and discover lots of Moths by placing plants and flowers to create expansive nocturnal and thriving ecosystems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/7a343c10488bd246aa4f8e2d0917ff2d.avif?t=1788296553\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras_big/7a343c10488bd246aa4f8e2d0917ff2d.avif?t=1788296553 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/extras/fd5a95533f4ba8668e7324993c32c0d3.avif?t=1788296553\" data-big-src=htt