 ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Design and build Mothpunk nature-dioramas. Use plants and terrain to re-wild ever-growing nocturnal biomes. Experiment with many ecosystems in this gentle strategy to attract and care for lots of moths.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/4219723ec35540ed92741e01ace9d15a68e97383/header.jpg?t=1788296553", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/67a44feeb53d14a41faad6ac29f4e327c9c86674/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788296553", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086570/67a44feeb53d14a41faad6ac29f4e327c9c86674/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788296553", "website": "https://flora.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core (Intel / AMD)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 750 / AMD Radeon HD 7770<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 11 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon (M1 and newer)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Most recent version of Ubuntu LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 5000 (AMD or NVIDIA equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "